WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.206
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:04.772 --> 00:00:07.230
SUJAA DEEPAK: Schlumberger is
a leading technology provider

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:08.160
in the energy sector.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.440
And it started on its Cloud
journey with the ambition

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.870
to be the leader in the
energy solutions industry.

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.540
In 2016, Schlumberger
partnered with Google

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.430
as the provider for
high-performance cloud

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.210
computing.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.640
This has resulted in the
industry-leading DELFI

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.470
cognitive exploration and
production environment.

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:27.300
It is an open, secure, scalable,
and fully managed ecosystem

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.960
connecting people, data, and
leading software applications

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.713
across the entire oil and
gas exploration landscape.

00:00:33.713 --> 00:00:35.130
NIGEL LESTER: The
DORA assessments

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.770
have allowed us to benchmark
against others in the energy

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.450
and digital industries.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:42.090
We have now clearly seen
that focusing on the DORA

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:44.100
recommendations to
test automation,

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.410
continuous delivery,
and monitoring,

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:49.350
has moved a significant number
of our solutions and services

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.788
into the high-performance
DORA categories.

00:00:51.788 --> 00:00:53.580
SUJAA DEEPAK: We
recognized early we needed

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.910
to invest in not just the
cloud and technology ecosystem

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:59.910
but in all its associated
practices, governance,

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:02.820
and the skills to enable our
people to deliver best in class

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.200
services to our customers.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.617
NIGEL LESTER: Our goal is to
improve the software delivery

00:01:06.617 --> 00:01:09.300
and operational performance
of our cloud-hosted products,

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.210
because we want to deliver
the best-in-class service

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:13.900
to our clients.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:15.360
SUJAA DEEPAK: So
what attracted us

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:18.090
was its holistic,
evidence-based approach, where

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:20.730
it focuses us to
improve on the most

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.940
impactful technical, process,
and cultural capabilities.

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:26.520
The impact is measured
by the four DORA metrics,

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.720
covering throughput
and stability.

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:31.710
NIGEL LESTER: It also helped
us to understand the results

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:35.790
and determine the most
effective way in order to--

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:38.010
the most effective
steps to take next.

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:40.260
So this has been one of
the critical things, which

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:45.240
has been identifying what is
the most impactful improvement

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:46.140
to make next.

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:48.120
And the Google team
have been incredibly

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.100
responsive in
helping us with this.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.710
It's been a very, very good
collaborative relationship.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.900
We would like to thank all
the staff at Schlumberger

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.820
for their commitment
and dedication

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:58.890
to improving our
customers' experience

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:02.220
by the wholehearted adoption
of the DORA initiative.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.950
And finally, thanks to
Google for this award.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:08.300
[MUSIC PLAYING]

